                       </group>\\n                                <group string=\\"HTML/Sanitization Properties\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html'\\">\\n                                    <group>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html'\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_overridable\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_tags\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_attributes\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                    <group>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_style\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"sanitize_form\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"strip_style\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                        <field name=\\"strip_classes\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'html' or sanitize == False\\"/>\\n                                    </group>\\n                                </group>\\n                                <group invisible=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"selection_ids\\">\\n                                        <list editable=\\"bottom\\">\\n                                            <field name=\\"sequence\\" widget=\\"handle\\"/>\\n                                            <field name=\\"value\\"/>\\n                                            <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                        </list>\\n                                    </field>\\n                                </group>\\n                            </page>\\n                            <page name=\\"compute\\" string=\\"Compute\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\">\\n                                <group>\\n                                    <field name=\\"related\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"depends\\" required=\\"bool(compute) and store\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"compute\\" widget=\\"code\\" options=\\"{'mode': 'python'}\\"/>\\n                                </group>\\n                                <div>\\n                                    <h3>How to define a computed field</h3>\\n                                    <p>Computed fields are defined with the fields\\n                                    <strong>Dependencies</strong> and <strong>Compute</strong>.</p>\\n                                    <p>The field <strong>Dependencies</strong> lists the fields that\\n                                    the current field depends on. It is a comma-separated list of\\n                                    field names, like <code>name, size</code>. You can also refer to\\n                                    fields accessible through other relational fields, for instance\\n                                    <code>partner_id.company_id.name</code>.</p>\\n                                    <p>The field <strong>Compute</strong> is the Python code to\\n                                    compute the value of the field on a set of records. The value of\\n                                    the field must be assigned to each record with a dictionary-like\\n                                    assignment.</p>\\n                                    <pre>\\n    for record in self:\\n        record['size'] = len(record.name)\\n</pre>\\n                                    <p>The only predefined variables are</p>\\n                                    <ul>\\n                                        <li><code>self</code> (the set of records to compute)</li>\\n                                        <li><code>datetime</code> (Python module)</li>\\n                                        <li><code>dateutil</code> (Python module)</li>\\n                                        <li><code>time</code> (Python module)</li>\\n                                    </ul>\\n                                    <p>Other features are accessible through <code>self</code>, like\\n                                    <code>self.env</code>, etc.</p>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </page>\\n                            <page name=\\"groups\\" string=\\"Access Rights\\">\\n                                <field name=\\"groups\\"/>\\n                            </page>\\n                        </notebook>\\n                    </sheet>\\n                </form>", "es_ES": "<form string=\\"Campos\\" duplicate=\\"false\\">\\n                    <sheet>\\n                        <group>\\n                            <group>\\n                                <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                <field name=\\"field_description\\"/>\\n                                <field name=\\"model_id\\" readonly=\\"state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                            </group>\\n                            <group>\\n                                <field name=\\"ttype\\"/>\\n                                <field name=\\"help\\"/>\\n                            </group>\\n                        </group>\\n                     