ergentes, clásicos imprescindibles, libros locales, ediciones especiales, cuadernos, regalos literarios y lecturas que no pueden faltar.\\n    </p>\\n                    <p><br/></p>\\n    </div>\\n                <div class=\\"offset-lg-1 pt16 pb16 col-lg-5\\">\\n                    <img src=\\"/html_editor/shape/theme_aviato/s_text_image.svg?c1=o-color-1\\" class=\\"img img-fluid mx-auto rounded\\" alt=\\"\\" loading=\\"lazy\\"/>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n        </div>\\n    </section><section class=\\"s_text_image pb112 pt0\\" data-snippet=\\"s_image_text\\">\\n        <div class=\\"container\\">\\n            <div class=\\"row align-items-center\\">\\n                <div class=\\"pt16 pb16 col-lg-5\\">\\n                    <img src=\\"/html_editor/shape/theme_aviato/s_image_text.svg?c1=o-color-1\\" class=\\"img img-fluid mx-auto rounded\\" alt=\\"\\" loading=\\"lazy\\"/>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\"offset-lg-1 pt16 pb16 col-lg-6\\">\\n                    <h2 class=\\"h3-fs\\">\\n        Selección de libros\\n    </h2>\\n                    <p>\\n        Nuestro objetivo es acercar la lectura y hacerla más inspiradora. Sea cual sea el libro que tenga en mente, contamos con la selección y la experiencia necesarias para encontrar la lectura perfecta\\n    </p>\\n                    <p><br/></p>\\n    </div>\\n            </div>\\n        </div>\\n    </section><section data-snippet=\\"s_dynamic_snippet_category_list\\" class=\\"s_dynamic_snippet_category_list oe_website_sale s_dynamic_category_clickable_items s_dynamic_snippet_category s_dynamic_category_no_arrows s_dynamic o_dynamic_snippet_empty pt64 s_product_public_category_clickable_items o_colored_level pb80\\" data-custom-template-data=\\"{}\\" data-number-of-records=\\"10\\" data-filter-id=\\"7\\" data-template-key=\\"website_sale.dynamic_filter_template_product_public_category_clickable_items\\" data-show-parent=\\"true\\" data-columns=\\"4\\" data-roun