     <h1 class="display-3">Lea<br/>sin prisa y con placer</h1>\n    <p class="lead">\n        <br/>Disfrute de las historias inolvidables y de la magia de leer. Relájese y cumpla sus sueños.<br/><br/></p>\n                    <p>\n                        <a class="btn btn-lg btn-primary o_translate_inline" href="/contactus">Explorar ahora</a>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class="o_grid_item o_grid_item_image g-col-lg-4 g-height-10 col-lg-4 d-lg-block d-none o_snippet_mobile_invisible" style="z-index: 2; grid-area: 1 / 8 / 11 / 12;">\n                    <img class="img img-fluid mx-auto rounded" src="/web/image/website.s_banner_default_image_2" alt="" loading="lazy"/>\n                </div>\n                <div class="o_grid_item o_grid_item_image g-col-lg-2 g-height-5 col-lg-2 d-lg-block d-none o_snippet_mobile_invisible" style="z-index: 3; grid-area: 2 / 11 / 7 / 13;">\n                    <img class="img img-fluid mx-auto rounded" src="/web/image/website.s_banner_default_image_3" alt="" loading="lazy"/>\n                </div>\n                <div class="o_grid_item g-col-lg-5 g-height-4 col-lg-5" style="z-index: 4; grid-area: 6 / 6 / 10 / 11;">\n                    <blockquote class="s_blockquote s_blockquote_with_line o_cc o_cc1 o_animable position-relative d-flex flex-column gap-4 w-100 mx-auto p-4 fst-normal shadow" data-vcss="001" data-snippet="s_blockquote" data-name="Blockquote">\n                        <div class="s_blockquote_line_elt position-absolute top-0 start-0 bottom-0 bg-o-color-1"/>\n                        <div class="s_blockquote_wrap_icon position-absolute top-0 start-50 translate-middle w-100">\n                            <i class="s_blockquote_icon fa fa-quote-right d-block mx-auto rounded bg-o-color-1" role="img"/>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class="s_blockquote_quote my-auto">\n        ¡Una librería encantadora! Encontrará libros únicos, recomendaciones expertas y un ambiente acogedor para leer y descubrir.\n    </p>\n                        <div class="s_blockquote_infos d-flex gap-2 flex-row align-items-start justify-content-start w-100 text-start">\n                            <img src="/web/image/website.s_blockquote_default_image" class="s_blockquote_avatar img rounded-circle" alt="" loading="lazy"/>\n                            <div class="s_blockquote_author">\n                                <span class="o_small"><strong>Laura Pérez</strong><br/> <span> Descubrió novelas en 2024 </span></span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </blockquote>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section><section class="s_text_image pt80 pb80" data-snippet="s_text_image">\n        <div class="container">\n            <div class="row align-items-center">\n                <div class="pt16 pb16 col-lg-6">\n                    <h2 class="h3-fs">\n        Lo que podemos hacer <b>por usted</b></h2>\n                    <p>\n        Nuestro equipo recorre librerías, editoriales y ferias para ofrecer a nuestros clientes recomendaciones de primera mano sobre novedades, autores emergentes, clásicos imprescindibles, libros locales, ediciones especiales, cuadernos, regalos literarios y lecturas que no pueden faltar.\n    </p>\n                    <p><br/></p>\n    </div>\n                <div class="offset-lg-1 pt16 pb16 col-lg-5">\n                    <img src="/html_editor/shape/theme_aviato/s_text_image.svg?c1=o-color-1" class="img img-fluid mx-auto rounded" alt="" loading="lazy"/>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section><section class="s_text_image pb112 pt0" data-snippet="s_image_text">\n        <div class="container">\n            <div class="row align-items-center">\n                <div class="pt16 pb16 col-lg-5">\n                    <img src="/html_editor/shape/theme_aviato/s_image_text.svg?c1=o-color-1" class="img img-fluid mx-auto rounded" alt="" loading="lazy"/>\n                </div>\n                <div class="offset-lg-1 pt16 pb16 col-lg-6">\n                    <h2 class="h3-fs">\n        Selección de libros\n    </h2>\n                    <p>\n        Nuestro objetivo es acercar la lectura y hacerla más inspiradora. Sea cual sea el libro que tenga en mente, contamos con la selección y la experiencia necesarias para encontrar la lectura perfecta\n    </p>\n                    <p><br/></p>\n    </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section><section data-snippet="s_dynamic_snippet_category_list" class="s_dynamic_snippet_category_list oe_website_sale s_dynamic_category_clickable_items s_dynamic_snippet_category s_dynamic_category_no_arrows s_dynamic o_dynamic_snippet_empty pt64 s_product_public_category_clickable_items o_colored_level pb80" data-custom-template-data="{}" data-number-of-records="10" data-filter-id="7" data-template-key="website_sale.dynamic_filter_template_product_public_category_clickable_items" data-show-parent="true" data-columns="4" data-rounded="2" data-gap="3" data-size="medium" data-alignment="center" data-oe-shape-data="{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;web_editor/Connections/20&quot;, &quot;colors&quot;:{&quot;c5&quot;:&quot;o-color-3&quot;}}" style="">\n            <div class="o_we_shape o_web_editor_Connections_20" style="background-image: url('/web_editor/shape/web_editor/Connections/20.svg?c5=o-color-3');"/><div class="s_dynamic_snippet_container container">\n                <div class="row s_nb_column_fixed">\n                    \n                    <section class="s_dynamic_snippet_holder d-none px-4 placeholder-glow">\n                        <div class="row">\n                            <span class="placeholder col-3 rounded"/>\n                            <span class="placeholder col-2 offset-7 rounded"/>\n                            <span class="placeholder mt-3 col-6 rounded"/>\n                        </div>\n                      