ds, ensuring that you find the perfect fit for your requirements. From individual users to businesses of all sizes, we offer pricing options that provide exceptional value without compromising on features or performance.</p>\n        <p>Experience the power of our software without breaking the bank – choose a plan that suits you best and start unlocking its full potential today.</p>\n    </xpath>\n<xpath expr="." position="attributes"><attribute name="t-name">website.new_page_template_pricing_s_text_block_2nd</attribute></xpath></data>\n\n	f	t	2026-11-24 18:48:00.717396	2026-11-24 18:48:00.717396	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	f
