1350	16	\N	1	2	Home	\N	website.homepage	qweb	website/data/website_data.xml	primary	{"en_US": "<t name=\\"Home\\" t-name=\\"website.homepage\\">\\n        <t t-call=\\"website.layout\\" pageName.f=\\"homepage\\">\\n            <div id=\\"wrap\\" class=\\"oe_structure\\"><section class=\\"s_text_cover o_colored_level o_cc o_cc2\\" data-snippet=\\"s_text_cover\\" data-name=\\"Portada de texto\\">\\n        <div class=\\"container-fluid\\">\\n            <div class=\\"row o_grid_mode\\" data-row-count=\\"11\\">\\n                <div class=\\"o_grid_item o_cc o_colored_level g-height-8 g-col-lg-8 col-lg-8 o_cc1\\" style=\\"z-index: 1; grid-area: 2 / 3 / 10 / 11; --grid-item-padding-x: 24px; --grid-item-padding-y: 24px; background-color: rgb(242, 218, 247);\\">\\n                    <h1 class=\\"display-3\\">&amp;nbsp;Nemea's Books<br/></h1>\\n                    <p class=\\"lead\\">\\n        <br/><strong>Nemea’s Books</strong> es una librería online dedicada a los lectores jóvenes y a todos aquellos que disfrutan perdiéndose entre historias. En ella podrás encontrar una variedad de libros de distintos géneros, desde romance, fantasía y misterio hasta clásicos y lecturas contemporáneas. Nuestro objetivo es crear un espacio donde cada lector pueda descubrir nuevas historias, encontrar su próxima lectura favorita y dejarse llevar por la magia de los libros.</p><a class=\\"btn btn-lg btn-primary o_translate_inline\\" href=\\"/contactus\\">&amp;nbsp;Empezar&amp;nbsp;</a></div>\\n                <div class=\\"o_grid_item g-height-11 o_cc oe_img_bg o_not_editable d-none d-lg-block o_snippet_mobile_invisible o_colored_level o_bg_img_center o_bg_img_origin_border_box g-col-lg-5 col-lg-5 o_cc1\\" style=\\"grid-area: 1 / 8 / 12 / 13; --grid-item-padding-x: 0px; --grid-item-padding-y: 0px; background-image: url(&quot;/web/image/website.s_text_cover_default_image&quot;); background-color: rgb(235, 235, 235);\\" data-mimetype=\\"image/jpeg\\" data-invisible=\\"1\\"/>\\n            </div>\\n        </div>\\n    </section><section class=\\"s_text_image pt80 pb80 o_colored_level\\" data-snippet=\\"s_text_image\\" data-name=\\"Texto - Imagen\\">\\n        <div class=\\"container\\">\\n            <div class=\\"row align-items-center\\">\\n                <div class=\\"pt16 pb16 col-lg-6 o_colored_level\\">\\n                    <h2 class=\\"h3-fs\\">\\n        Lo que podemos hacer <b>por usted</b></h2>\\n                    <p>\\n        Nuestro equipo recorre librerías, editoriales y ferias para ofrecer a nuestros clientes recomendaciones de primera mano sobre novedades, autores emergentes, clásicos imprescindibles, libros locales, ediciones especiales, cuadernos, regalos literarios y lecturas que no pueden faltar.\\n    </p>\\n                    <p><br/></p>\\n    </div>\\n                <div class=\\"offset-lg-1 pt16 pb16 col-lg-5 o_colored_level\\">\\n                    <img src=\\"/html_editor/shape/theme_aviato/s_text_image.svg?c1=o-color-1\\" class=\\"img img-fluid mx-auto rounded\\" alt=\\"\\" loading=\\"lazy\\"/>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n        </div>\\n    </section><section class=\\"s_text_image pb112 pt0 o_colored_level\\" data-snippet=\\"s_image_text\\" data-name=\\"Imagen - Texto\\">\\n        <div class=\\"container\\">\\n            <div class=\\"row align-items-center\\">\\n                <div class=\\"pt16 pb16 col-lg-5 o_colored_level\\">\\n                    <img src=\\"/html_editor/shape/theme_aviato/s_image_text.svg?c1=o-color-1\\" class=\\"img img-fluid mx-auto rounded\\" alt=\\"\\" loading=\\"lazy\\"/>\\n                </div>\\n                <div class=\\"offset-lg-1 pt16 pb16 col-lg-6 o_colored_level\\">\\n                    <h2 class=\\"h3-fs\\">\\n        Selección de libros\\n    </h2>\\n                    <p>\\n        Nuestro objetivo es acercar la lectura y hacerla más inspiradora. Sea cual sea el libro que tenga en mente, contamos con la selección y la experiencia necesarias para encontrar la lectura perfecta\\n    </p>\\n                    <p><br/></p>\\n    </div>\\n            </div>\\n        </div>\\n    </section><section data-snippet=\\"s_dynamic_snippet_category_list\\" class=\\"s_dynamic_snippet_category_list oe_website_sale s_dynamic_category_clickable_items s_dynamic_snippet_category s_dynamic_category_no_arrows s_dynamic pt64 s_product_public_category_clickable_items o_colored_level pb80 o_dynamic_snippet_empty\\" data-custom-template-data=\\"{&quot;size&quot;:2,&quot;alignmentClass&quot;:&quot;align_category_center&quot;,&quot;buttonText&quot;:&quot;Explorar ahora&quot;,&quot;colSpanTwo&quot;:true,&quot;parentCategoryId&quot;:null}\\" data-number-of-records=\\"10\\" data-filter-id=\\"7\\" data-template-key=\\"website_sale.dynamic_filter_template_product_public_category_clickable_items\\" data-show-parent=\\"true\\" data-columns=\\"4\\" data-rounded=\\"2\\" data-gap=\\"3\\" data-size=\\"medium\\" data-alignment=\\"center\\" data-oe-shape-data=\\"{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;web_editor/Connections/20&quot;, &quot;colors&quot;:{&quot;c5&quot;:&quot;o-color-3&quot;}}\\" data-button=\\"Explorar ahora\\" data-name=\\"Lista de categorías\\">\\n            <div class=\\"o_we_shape o_web_editor_Connections_20\\" style=\\"background-image: url(&quot;/web_editor/shape/web_editor/Connections/20.svg?c5=o-color-3&quot;);\\"/><div class=\\"s_dynamic_snippet_container container\\">\\n                <div class=\\"row s_nb_column_fixed\\">\\n                    \\n                    <section class=\\"s_dynamic_snippet_holder d-none px-4 placeholder-glow o_colored_level\\">\\n                        <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                            <span class=\\"placeholder col-3 rounded\\"/>\\n                            <span class=\\"placeholder col-2 offset-7 rounded\\"/>\\n                            <span class=\\"placeholder mt-3 col-6 rounded\\"/>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div class=\\"row mt-4\\">\\n                            <span class=\\"placeholder col-12 rounded\\" style=\\"height: 250px;\\"/>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </section>\\n                    <section class=\\"justify-content-between d-flex s_dynamic_snippet_title oe_unremovable oe_unmovable flex-column flex-md-row mb-lg-0 pb-3 pb-md-0 s_col_no_resize\\">\\n                        <div>\\n                <h2 class=\\"h3\\">Creando rincones con alma</h2>\\n                <p class=\\"lead\\">Diseñamos librerías cálidas y elegantes que invitan a leer y quedarse.</p>\\n            </div>\\n        <div>\\n                            <a title=\\"Ver todo\\" href=\\"/shop\\">Ver catálogo</a>\\n                        </div>\\n                    </section>\\n                    <section class=\\"s_dynamic_snippet_content oe_unremovable oe_unmovable o_not_editable col s_col_no_resize o_colored_level\\">\\n                        <div class=\\"css_non_editable_mode_hidden\\">\\n                            <div class=\\"missing_option_warning alert alert-info fade show d-none d-print-none rounded-0\\">\\n                                Tu snippet dinámico se mostrará aquí... Este mensaje aparece porque no has proporcionado suficientes opciones para recuperar su contenido.<br/>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div class=\\"dynamic_snippet_template\\"/>\\n                    </section>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n        </section><section class=\\"s_picture pt88 pb88 o_cc o_cc5 o_colored_level\\" data-snippet=\\"s_picture\\" data-name=\\"Título - Imagen\\">\\n        <div class=\\"container\\">\\n            <h2 style=\\"text-align: center;\\">\\n        <font style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">Descubra historias que inspiran cada día</font>\\n    </h2>\\n            <p style=\\"text-align: center;\\">\\n        Embárquese en un viaje literario inolvidable por las historias más fascinantes del mundo, cuidadosamente seleccionadas para usted.\\n    </p>\\n            <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                <div class=\\"col-lg-12 pt24 o_colored_level\\" style=\\"text-align: center;\\">\\n                    <figure class=\\"figure w-100\\">\\n                        <img src=\\"/web/image/website.s_popup_default_image\\" class=\\"figure-img img-fluid rounded\\" alt=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 100%;\\" loading=\\"lazy\\"/>\\n                        <figcaption class=\\"figure-caption text-muted mt-2\\">\\n        Edición especial, tapa dura\\n    </figcaption>\\n                    </figure>\\n                </div>\\n            </div>\\n        </div>\\n    </section><section class=\\"s_title o_cc pt72 pb0 o_colored_level o_cc2\\" data-vcss=\\"001\\" data-snippet=\\"s_title\\" data-name=\\"Título\\" style=\\"background-color: rgb(236, 198, 236);\\">\\n        <div class=\\"s_allow_columns container\\">\\n            <h2 class=\\"text-align: left;\\"><font style=\\"color: rgb(68, 33, 89);\\">Los mejores libros</font></h2>\\n    </div>\\n    </section><section class=\\"s_masonry_block o_cc o_cc1 pt24 pb104 o_colored_level\\" data-vcss=\\"001\\" data-vxml=\\"001\\" data-oe-shape-data=\\"{'shape':'html_builder/Connections/20','colors':{'c5':'o-color-3'},'flip':['y'],'showOnMobile':true}\\" data-snippet=\\"s_masonry_block_default_template\\">\\n        <div class=\\"o_we_shape o_html_builder_Connections_20 o_shape_show_mobile\\" style=\\"background-image: url(&quot;/html_editor/shape/html_builder/Connections/20.svg?c5=o-color-3&amp;flip=y&quot;); background-position: 50% 0%;\\"/>\\n        <div class=\\"container\\">\\n            \\n        <div class=\\"row o_grid_mode\\" data-row-count=\\"8\\" style=\\"gap: 16px;\\">\\n            <div class=\\"o_grid_item o_grid_item_image g-height-8 g-col-lg-5 col-lg-5 text-center order-lg-0 oe_img_bg o_bg_img_center o_cc o_cc5 overflow-hidden justify-content-end rounded o_colored_level o_bg_img_origin_border_box\\" data-name=\\"Block